# Brainstorm: Dark Theme Color Mapping từ Figma Design

**Date:** 2026-01-12
**Status:** Analysis Complete

---

## 1. Figma Color Palette Analysis

Từ Figma node `3516-212414`, design đã định nghĩa bảng màu dark theme như sau:

### Background Colors (Cột trái)

| Tên | Hex | Mục đích |
|-----|-----|----------|
| background | `#131313` | Nền chính của app |
| chat background | `#1a1a1a` | Nền khu vực chat |
| dropdown | `#1f2022` | Background dropdown/popover |
| background button | `#1a1d22` | Background button secondary |
| card/chat | `#24282d` | Card, chat bubble received |
| hover/button active | `#2d3239` | Hover states |
| active 1 | gradient cyan-green | Active accent |
| active 2 | `#40f0d0` (primary-100) | Primary active |
| active 3 | gradient teal | Secondary active |
| chat | gradient cyan→green | Chat bubble sent gradient |
| chat active | gradient darker | Chat bubble active |
| error | `#e84848` | Error/destructive |
| highlight | `#43f9ff` | Highlight/focus |
| bôi đen (selection) | `#3c6b9b` | Text selection |

### Text/Icon Colors (Cột phải)

| Tên | Hex/Value | Mục đích |
|-----|-----------|----------|
| text/primary | `#ffffff` | Text chính |
| text/secondary | `rgba(255,255,255,0.8)` | Text phụ |
| text/tertiary 1 | `rgba(255,255,255,0.6)` | Text mờ hơn |
| icon/text/tertiary 2 | `rgba(255,255,255,0.5)` | Icon/text rất mờ |
| icon | `rgba(255,255,255,0.4)` | Icon inactive |
| icon | `rgba(255,255,255,0.2)` | Icon rất mờ |
| border | `rgba(255,255,255,0.1)` | Border mặc định |
| text/neutral 300 | `#c5ced8` | Neutral text sáng |
| text/neutral 400 | `#afbfd0` | Neutral text medium |
| text/neutral 500 | `#7d91a6` | Neutral text tối |
| gradient stroke chat | `#0c4438` border | Border chat gradient |
| gradient stroke chat | `rgba(255,255,255,0.2)` border | Border light |

---

## 2. So sánh với CSS Variables hiện tại

### Current Implementation (Slate-based)

Hiện tại `.dark` class đang dùng **Tailwind Slate palette**:
- `--background: #0f172a` (slate-900)
- `--card: #1e293b` (slate-800)
- `--grey-100: #1e293b` (slate-800)

### Figma Design (Custom darker palette)

Figma design dùng **màu tối hơn và thuần đen hơn**:
- background: `#131313` (gần như pure black)
- card: `#24282d` (dark charcoal)
- dropdown: `#1f2022` (dark grey)

**Key Difference:** Figma palette có undertone **neutral/warm**, còn Slate có undertone **blue/cool**.

---

## 3. Đề xuất áp dụng

### Option A: Full Figma Compliance (Recommended)

Thay thế hoàn toàn CSS variables trong `.dark` block theo Figma:

```css
.dark {
    color-scheme: dark;

    /* === BACKGROUNDS === */
    --background: #131313;           /* Main background */
    --background-chat: #1a1a1a;      /* Chat area background */
    --card: #24282d;                 /* Cards, panels */
    --card-foreground: #ffffff;
    --popover: #1f2022;              /* Dropdown, popover */
    --popover-foreground: #ffffff;

    /* === TEXT === */
    --foreground: #ffffff;                    /* Primary text */
    --text-secondary: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);  /* Secondary text */
    --text-tertiary: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);   /* Tertiary text */
    --muted-foreground: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);/* Muted text/icons */

    /* === INTERACTIVE === */
    --button-bg: #1a1d22;            /* Button background */
    --hover: #2d3239;                /* Hover states */
    --selection: #3c6b9b;            /* Text selection */
    --highlight: #43f9ff;            /* Focus/highlight */

    /* === BORDERS === */
    --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    --border-light: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    --border-chat: #0c4438;          /* Chat bubble border */

    /* === STATUS === */
    --destructive: #e84848;

    /* === ICONS === */
    --icon-default: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    --icon-muted: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);

    /* === NEUTRAL TEXT SCALE === */
    --neutral-300: #c5ced8;
    --neutral-400: #afbfd0;
    --neutral-500: #7d91a6;

    /* === ACCENT/ACTIVE === */
    --primary: #40f0d0;              /* primary-100 */
    --primary-foreground: #131313;
}
```

**Pros:**
- 100% match với Figma design
- Consistent với design system
- Designer và dev cùng reference

**Cons:**
- Cần update nhiều components đang hardcode màu Slate
- Có thể cần thêm CSS variables mới

### Option B: Hybrid Approach

Giữ structure hiện tại, chỉ update key colors:

```css
.dark {
    /* Update backgrounds only */
    --background: #131313;
    --card: #24282d;
    --popover: #1f2022;

    /* Keep existing text/border logic */
    --foreground: #ffffff;
    --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
}
```

**Pros:**
- Ít thay đổi hơn
- Ít risk break existing components

**Cons:**
- Không fully match Figma
- Có thể có inconsistency

---

## 4. New CSS Variables cần thêm

Dựa trên Figma, cần bổ sung:

```css
:root {
    /* Thêm vào light theme */
    --text-tertiary: var(--grey-400);
    --icon-default: var(--grey-500);
    --icon-muted: var(--grey-300);
    --selection: #cce5ff;
    --highlight: var(--primary-100);
    --background-chat: var(--grey-100);
}

.dark {
    /* Override cho dark */
    --text-tertiary: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    --icon-default: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    --icon-muted: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    --selection: #3c6b9b;
    --highlight: #43f9ff;
    --background-chat: #1a1a1a;
}
```

---

## 5. Mapping Table: Figma → CSS Variable

| Figma Name | CSS Variable | Light Value | Dark Value |
|------------|--------------|-------------|------------|
| background | `--background` | `#ffffff` | `#131313` |
| chat background | `--background-chat` | `#f5f5f5` | `#1a1a1a` |
| dropdown | `--popover` | `#ffffff` | `#1f2022` |
| background button | `--button-secondary-bg` | `#ffffff` | `#1a1d22` |
| card/chat | `--card` | `#ffffff` | `#24282d` |
| hover/button active | `--hover` | `#f0f0f0` | `#2d3239` |
| text/primary | `--foreground` | `#1a2229` | `#ffffff` |
| text/secondary | `--text-secondary` | `#495366` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.8)` |
| text/tertiary | `--text-tertiary` | `#868a89` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.6)` |
| border | `--border` | `#e8edf2` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.1)` |
| error | `--destructive` | `#dc2626` | `#e84848` |
| highlight | `--highlight` | `#40f0d0` | `#43f9ff` |
| bôi đen | `--selection` | `#cce5ff` | `#3c6b9b` |

---

## 6. Recommendation

**Đề xuất:** Implement **Option A (Full Figma Compliance)** với các bước:

1. **Phase 1:** Update `.dark` block trong `style.css` với đúng Figma colors
2. **Phase 2:** Thêm new CSS variables (`--background-chat`, `--text-tertiary`, etc.)
3. **Phase 3:** Update `@theme inline` block để expose new variables cho Tailwind
4. **Phase 4:** Gradual refactor components từ hardcoded colors → CSS variables

**Ưu tiên:** Background colors trước (visual impact lớn nhất), sau đó text colors, cuối cùng là borders/interactive states.

---

## 7. Unresolved Questions

1. **Gradient colors:** Figma có nhiều gradient cho active states - có cần implement tất cả hay chỉ solid colors?
2. **Chat-specific colors:** `--background-chat` có cần thiết hay dùng chung `--card`?
3. **Selection color:** Browser default hay custom `::selection` CSS?
</file>

